hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1548","Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna told us, Al-Dahhak bin Mukhlid told us, Sufyan told us, Abdullah bin Abi Bakr told me, on the authority of Sa’id bin Al-Musayyab, on the authority of Abu Saeed Al-Khudri, said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “So when you stand up, straighten your ranks, and block the gap. I see you behind my back.”"
